          "title": "You'll want to know: भावः",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भावः — bhāvaḥ — \"a feeling; a state of mind\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भावः हृदये जायते। bhāvaḥ hṛdaye jāyate. A feeling arises in the heart."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भावः (bhāvaḥ) is built on the root √bhū, \"to be, to become\"; MW gives bhāva the senses \"a state of mind or body, a way of feeling\" and, in poetics, \"emotion\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
